{"id":"411974","name":"家常速食胡辣汤","author":"早早妈妈晚晚妈妈","authorId":"11025927","desc":"","cover":"images/411974/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"胡辣汤料包","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"一小块"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"1/4块"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"一把"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"一根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备材料。","img":"images/411974/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把干菜包放入大碗里。","img":"images/411974/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加适量温水泡十分钟泡发。","img":"images/411974/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"木耳，豆腐，胡萝卜，午餐肉切丝，香菜切末。","img":"images/411974/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放入800ml清水。","img":"images/411974/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入泡发的干菜。","img":"images/411974/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入胡萝卜，木耳，豆腐，午餐肉丝，煮开后再煮2分钟。","img":"images/411974/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"粉包放入一小碗清水中。","img":"images/411974/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调成糊。","img":"images/411974/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入烧开的汤中。","img":"images/411974/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上香菜末。","img":"images/411974/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"按照个人喜欢放入辣椒。","img":"images/411974/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}